From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Astrovsky <astrouski@google.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 10:30:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wifi-scripts: fix active_ifnames for OWE transition
 interfaces

Previously, during the OWE transition setup, the base interface name
was mistakenly pushed to the active_ifnames array twice due to a
copy/paste slip. Because this array is now passed directly as the
keep_devices argument to the wdev.uc set_config call, the newly
allocated OWE transition interface was completely missing from the
keep list.

This meant the transition interface never reached keep_devices and
could be incorrectly orphaned or removed during a reload. Update the
array push statement to use owe_transition_ifname so the correct
interface is preserved.

Signed-off-by: Alexander Astrovsky <astrouski@google.com>
Link: https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/pull/24621
[Crescentm: from OpenWrt PR #24621 head 2589982754991c4af392e2b4e414550cd86bcca1, commit 2589982754991c4af392e2b4e414550cd86bcca1]
---
 files-ucode/lib/netifd/wireless/mac80211.sh | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/files-ucode/lib/netifd/wireless/mac80211.sh b/files-ucode/lib/netifd/wireless/mac80211.sh
index 9c2e9261..8b1d3524 100755
--- a/files-ucode/lib/netifd/wireless/mac80211.sh
+++ b/files-ucode/lib/netifd/wireless/mac80211.sh
@@ -243,7 +243,7 @@ function setup() {
 		if (v.config.encryption == 'owe' && v.config.owe_transition) {
 			mode_idx = idx[mode]++;
 			v.config.owe_transition_ifname = data.ifname_prefix + mode + mode_idx;
-			push(active_ifnames, v.config.ifname);
+			push(active_ifnames, v.config.owe_transition_ifname);
 		}
 
 		switch (mode) {
